        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ 9200MF-11/l01707-6016 8 Foot Fire Rated Mullion</b>\r\n<p>\r\nKey removable 8 Foot Fire Rated Mullion for use <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-fire-door-rim-exit-device-pdq-6200rf\">PDQ 6200RF Heavy Duty Fire Door Rim Exit Device</a>,  <a href=\"/products/motorized-electric-latch-rim-exit-device-pdq-6200rf630mlr\">PDQ 6200RF630MLR Motorized Electric Latch Retraction Exit Device</a>,  <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-rim-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300r\">PDQ 6200R Rim Panic Device</a> and other <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\">Rim Panic Devices</a> on pairs of doors. Field sizable- Can be cut for shorter frames. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMullion can be removed by turning the keyed lock on top. Small profile base plate prevents interference when moving objects through doorway.  Field sizable for shorter doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nMullion kit includes top and bottom bracket set, mullion tube, shims and Lock Cylinder. Meets requirements of the <b>Buy American Act</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> for PDQ 9200MF-11 8 Foot Mullion\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Height: 8 Feet or Less</li>\r\n<li>Mullion Tube: 11 Gauge Steel, 2\" wide x 3\" deep</li>\r\n<li>Finish: 689 Aluminum Powder Coat</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed for 3 Hr Fire Doors</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Keyway: Schlage \"C\" Standard.</li>\r\n<li>1 Year Limited Manufacturer Warranty </li>\r\n\r\n<!-- <li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/F90R-install.pdf?v=1704262420\"><b>DETEX F90Rx8 installation Instructions</a></b></li> -->\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>** Made to order item. Please allow 2 weeks to ship</b>\r\n</p>",
